{"sections":[{"slug":"仰范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"仰范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">仰范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"仰范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">极限</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">余极限</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">仰范畴中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/极限","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">极限</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">等同于原范畴中的极限</span>.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">仰范畴</span> $\\mathcal C_{X/}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/余极限","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">余极限</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">等同于</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的原图表加上</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">到各对象的态射后所得图表的余极限</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">例如</span> $\\mathcal C_{X/}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中</span> $X\\to Y, X\\to Z$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/和(范畴论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">和</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中</span> $Z \\leftarrow X \\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/推出","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">推出</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">上述结论与</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/俯范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">俯范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的结论是对称的</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}